Third-party code
----------------
No third-party source is bundled here. Runtime and optional dependencies —
Flask, httpx, rich, cryptography, phonenumbers, and the CLI tools
(sherlock, maigret, holehe, user-scanner, blackbird, ignorant,
phoneinfoga, exiftool, shodan) — are installed from their own sources and
remain under their own licenses. Each engine package's `__init__.py`
carries an SPDX identifier so the license travels with the code.